WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:02.390
The correct answer is, a vector image,

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:07.250
the reason being that vector images
scale without quality degradation.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.020
This means that no matter how big they
are, they will always look the same.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.640
This is definitely useful if you're
trying to make something that's

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.320
50 meters wide.

